      "content": "thanks for the tip about choline. i feel like i check everything online but doctors just make everything seem so scary and expensive lol. i'm just looking for something simple i can grab today. is there any specific dose of something like magnesium or maybe 5-HTP that i should look for that's definitely fine with my pill? i just want to know what's safe to try right now so i can stop feeling like this.",
